      "content": "René Féret (26 May 1945 – 28 April 2015) was a French actor, screenwriter, film director and producer. His film \"Solemn Communion\", was entered into the 1977 Cannes Film Festival. In \"The Man Who Wasn't There\" (\"L'Homme qui n'était pas là\"), his 1987 film adaption of Roderick MacLeish's novel, he played alongside Claude Jade in the leading role of Charles Elaine.",
